#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: en/chapters/quick_start_guide.xml:102
msgid ""
"After you have decompressed the phpBB3 archive and uploaded the files to the"
" location where you want it to be installed, you need to enter the "
"<acronym>URL</acronym> into your browser to open the installation screen. "
"The first time you point your browser to the <acronym>URL</acronym> "
"(<uri>http://www.example.com/phpBB3</uri> for instance), phpBB will detect "
"that it is not yet installed and automatically redirect you to the "
"installation screen."
